	(text "状態表示 LED" (at 198.12 33.02 0) (effects (font (size 1.78 1.78) bold) (justify left top)) (uuid "9b267886-c291-406f-be80-16c6123f8bd0"))
	(text "J1の物理端子順とスイッチの抵抗値は実測で確認。\nADC入力の保護・フィルタは未設計。" (at 27.94 87.63 0) (effects (font (size 1.35 1.35)) (justify left top)) (uuid "34bc5abc-c0c6-448f-818f-3f39d29e6b40"))
	(text "U1は開発ボードの機能端子を表示。\n実機の端子配列・基板型番は要確認。" (at 120.65 92.71 0) (effects (font (size 1.18 1.18)) (justify left top)) (uuid "a5716edb-19cc-47b2-a75f-9cfdf152d9e5"))
	(text "R3の抵抗値は未確認。\nD12（GPIO12 / MTDI）は起動ストラップ端子。\nLEDを接続した状態で起動を実機確認。" (at 198.12 80.01 0) (effects (font (size 1.35 1.35)) (justify left top)) (uuid "263fa0b0-8fd1-49cb-bad2-c90f97636e4c"))
	(rectangle
