	(text "USB 5 V → VIN\n電源経路は未接続" (at 106.68 126.365 0) (effects (font (size 1.58 1.58))) (uuid "4c1f25ac-f588-4281-94f1-9b3057ff4f42"))
	(text "J2は給電端子の仮表記。USBコネクタの種類と\n開発ボード上のUSB–VIN間の経路は未確認。" (at 27.94 148.59 0) (effects (font (size 1.35 1.35)) (justify left top)) (uuid "04c32aec-0f13-406e-96fb-c20165eca7de"))
	(text "スーパーキャパシタ直列" (at 192.405 118.11 0) (effects (font (size 1.55 1.55) bold) (justify left top)) (uuid "79c9dab3-e222-4805-8959-d31d3331ec55"))
	(text "C1・C2は各 3 F / 2.7 V（直列で公称 1.5 F）。\n充電電流制限・逆流防止は未設計。\n各セルの電圧バランス回路は未実装。\n保持時間とVINの動作下限は未確認。" (at 192.405 123.19 0) (effects (font (size 1.35 1.35)) (justify left top)) (uuid "718d245d-bc53-4309-883b-50212caeff1b"))
	(text "ACC  未実装" (at 22.86 175.26 0) (effects (font (size 1.78 1.78) bold) (justify left top)) (uuid "2b86ffd5-c881-4917-9466-56dcae8a497e"))
